mos6_nocap nom (27 C, m=1), cut (vgs=0.3, vds=2.0, vbs=-0.5), dc
load "spice/mos6.osdi"
model vs vsource
model nm sp_mos6 type=1 vto=0.7 kv=2 nv=0.8 kc=5e-5 nc=1.2 lambda0=0.02 lambda1=0.01 gamma=0.5 gamma1=0.1 sigma=0.01 phi=0.7
vd (d 0) vs dc=1.99999
vg (g 0) vs dc=0.3
vb (b 0) vs dc=-0.5
m1 (d g 0 b) nm w=10u l=2u ad=20p as=20p pd=24u ps=24u
control
  options temp=27 tnom=27 reltol=1e-9 abstol=1e-15 rawfile="ascii"
  analysis op1 op
endc
